{
  "name": "Intimidating Presence",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you enter a frenzy, you also adopt a menacing presence that frightens foes around you. Any hostile creature that starts its turn within 30 feet of you while you are in a frenzy or enters that area for the first time on a turn and can see or hear you, must succeed on a Wisdom Saving Throw (DC equal to 8 + your Proficiency bonus + your Strength modifier) or be Frightened of you until the start of its next turn.</p><p>If a creature's Saving Throw is successful, it is Immune to your Intimidating Presence for the next 24 hours.</p>",
